    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061110.0092\n\nJAKARTA, Nov. 10 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nIndonesian shares end firmer\n\n\n\n\nShare prices on the Jakarta Stock Exchange ended higher Friday with the composite index up by 4.6 points to close at 1,664.8 points.\n\nTurnovers totaled 1.3 billion shares worth 1.8 trillion rupiah (193.6 million U.S. dollars).\n\nDecliners narrowly led advancers 54 to 51, with 86 other issues left unchanged.",
